ke a chance for once in her life. All the women at Drovers enjoy the opportunity to dress up for the biggest event on the Gungellan social calendar. Jodi is voted Miss Gungellan but to everybody's surprise and Liz's horror, she gives up the crown in order to go off up north with her father and Meg. Only trouble is, Meg is having second thoughts. And so too is Kevin.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q0ql37CkgzTQb1CrVipKb2raIFu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q0ql37CkgzTQb1CrVipKb2raIFu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2041/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"140368","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Tess feels increasingly isolated from Claire, she works hard to bring Nick and Alex back together, an effort which backfires when she lets a Ryan family secret out of the bag.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rbbSHBB9mBxl6NixhTkSPfJHw4i.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rbbSHBB9mBxl6NixhTkSPfJHw4i.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2041/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"140369","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Becky realises that she has no choice but to tell Claire that Peter is married and Tess accepts a partnership in the city.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c46AZWkOvDul1H5TFqJLzgdPHrx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c46AZWkOvDul1H5TFqJLzgdPHrx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2041/season/2/episode