/season/2/episode/14"},{"id":"140419","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Jodi's cooking gives five young men food poisoning, the women of Drovers must convince the Killarney men to put on a strip show. At the same time, Claire and Alex's business partnership gets off to a rocky start, whilst Nick and Tess form a partnership of their own.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rosVpV03SZUI9qPrqAqekTGMYIL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rosVpV03SZUI9qPrqAqekTGMYIL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2041/season/2/episode/15"},{"id":"140420","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Professional thieves clean out both Drover's Run and Wilgul, exposing some of the fault lines in the women's relationships.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-08-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gmdLxzls0nIKzom12vd27y22O8Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmdLxzls0nIKzom12vd27y22O8Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/2041/season/2/episode/16"},{"id":"140421","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Romance is in the air for Jodi as Alberto returns, but Homestay guests bring problems for Tess. Marty comes back and sparks fly between him and Claire, until a certain incident with one of the guests happens and the Police is called.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":44,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/km4hI5QI2rmZudBdaWVK1NT78u4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/km4h